mL), Grubbs II (60 mg, 0:071 mmol), and the mixture was stirred at 65°C
for 2 h. The mixture was concentrated in vacuo, and the residue was
purified by flash column chromatography (100% EtOAc). The title compound
as a brown oil (135 mg, 77%). Purity: >95%. RP-HPLC: R t = 4:54 min, IR
(neat) cm-1: 3234, 3068, 2934, 2840, 1640, 1605, 1504, 1295, 1251, 1171,
1023, 843; 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ 9.75 (s, 1H), 7.80 (d, J = 8:8
Hz, 2H), 6.99 (d, J = 8:8 Hz, 2H), 5.83 (ddd, J = 14:9; 6:7; 1:5 Hz, 2H),
4.61 (dd, J = 6:6; 5:4 Hz, 1H), 4.08-3.73 (m, 6H), 3.80 (s, 3H),
3.47-3.25 (m, 2H); 13C NMR (75MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ 165.4, 161.7, 129.1,
128.8, 127.0, 125.6, 113.6, 73.6, 64.2, 60.6, 55.4; HRMS (ESI) m/z: calcd
for C13H16N2O3 [M+ H]+ 249.1234, found 249.1234.
